      "hint": "Denominator of fractional exponent is the root, numerator is the power. a^(m/n) = (nth root of a)^m.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "8^(4/3) = (cbrt(8))^4     [denominator 3 = cube root]",
        "= 2^4                      [cbrt(8) = 2]",
